["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ResponsibilityType/custody", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Custody refers to the responsibility, control, and safekeeping of an asset, person, or legal entity. It involves both physical possession and legal authority over something or someone.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
